1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,633
Day sixty-seven. The silence gets
heavy. Not quiet. Heavy.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:07,600
Sixty-seven. Yes. I'm going to say it.
Six... seven.

3
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:13,867
Three days without a word. I noticed
when I said good morning to the fridge
and my voice cracked.

4
00:00:14,567 --> 00:00:18,533
Rule seven. Talk out loud every day.
To anyone. To anything.

5
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:24,000
In a shop window, a mannequin with a
broken arm. You carry him home on your
back.

6
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:29,700
Meet Greg. Greg listens. Greg never
interrupts. Greg is a mannequin. I
know.

7
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:35,567
Greg doesn't answer. But your own
voice does something to the room. It
makes it feel lived in.
